00:39:09.030 --> 00:39:10.440
So, with that, let me just open

00:39:10.440 --> 00:39:15.720
up the local dashboard
that's running

00:39:15.720 --> 00:39:20.750
and let me just
select an existing run.

00:39:20.750 --> 00:39:24.920
Okay. So this is a completed
run with our low-level APIs.

00:39:24.920 --> 00:39:28.910
You can see --
hopefully, it's visible.

00:39:28.910 --> 00:39:30.890
You can see that the reward
and accuracy is increasing

00:39:30.890 --> 00:39:34.170
over time, just like we
saw in the previous one.

00:39:34.170 --> 00:39:35.730
But you also get
more details here.

00:39:35.730 --> 00:39:38.370
So, for instance, you see that
