00:41:26.700 --> 00:41:29.460
And so some of you who are not
data scientists might start

00:41:29.460 --> 00:41:31.020
to feel a little anxious.

00:41:31.020 --> 00:41:36.690
Me, I hear fine-tuning is great,
but this sounds really hard.

00:41:36.690 --> 00:41:40.020
One common complaint we hear
