00:41:44.040 --> 00:41:46.110
I tried fine-tuning once.

00:41:46.110 --> 00:41:47.820
I made the model worse.

00:41:47.820 --> 00:41:49.710
I'm never doing this again."

00:41:49.710 --> 00:41:51.960
And the good news
is we hear you,

00:41:51.960 --> 00:41:54.750
and we've added a
fine-tuning skill.

00:41:54.750 --> 00:41:57.960
So you can use your
favorite coding agent

00:41:57.960 --> 00:42:01.320
and natural language to tell
it what you want to do,

00:42:01.320 --> 00:42:03.150
and it's going to
figure that out.

00:42:03.150 --> 00:42:06.120
And since I said
