00:44:54.270 --> 00:44:58.620
And I can see that the
fine-tuned 4.1 mini gets almost

00:44:58.620 --> 00:45:02.730
the same mean score, actually a
slightly higher pass at eight.

00:45:02.730 --> 00:45:06.330
And so, I was able to do
